# Data Classification

Every dataset (and every column of every table) in `data/` is classified
into exactly one tier before it is used or shared. When in doubt, classify
one tier stricter.

| Tier | Meaning | May leave `data/`? |
| --- | --- | --- |
| PUBLIC | Publishable as-is | Yes, anywhere |
| INTERNAL | Project-internal, no personal data | Yes, inside the team/organisation |
| RESTRICTED | Personal or otherwise sensitive data (identifiable or pseudonymised) | Only under a signed data transfer agreement, see `sharing/` |
| ANONYMIZED EXTRACT | Derived output that passed the de-identification protocol | Only after the transfer checklist, logged in `sharing/TRANSFER_LOG.csv` |

